sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant BFF
    participant KC as Keycloak
    participant API as OLAP REST
    participant Decoder as JWT Decoder
    participant Converter as Role Converter
    participant Jax as Jersey SecurityContext
    User->>BFF: inicia sesión DSS
    BFF->>KC: OIDC
    KC-->>BFF: access token
    BFF->>API: petición + Bearer
    API->>Decoder: validar firma, iss, tiempo, aud
    Decoder->>KC: JWKS si no está cacheado
    KC-->>Decoder: claves públicas
    Decoder-->>API: JWT validado
    API->>Converter: convertir resource_access.olap-service.roles
    Converter-->>API: ROLE_ADMIN / ROLE_USER
    API->>Jax: propagar principal/authorities
    Jax-->>API: recurso con SecurityContext
    API-->>BFF: resultado o 401/403
